{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for speed. Designed for precision. This is racing stripped down to its core\u2014just you, the track, and the clock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this sci-fi <strong>time trial</strong>, you\u2019ll take on  high-speed tracks with nothing in your way except your own limits. There are no opponents, no explosions\u2014just clean, responsive handling and the <strong>brutal pursuit of a faster lap</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every second matters. Every mistake sticks. The difference between a smooth run and a reset is often a single input too late. Your biggest enemy? Your own skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is about learning the lines, trusting your instincts, unlocking and customizing new cars, and pushing to the top of the <strong>leaderboard</strong>. Instant restarts keep the momentum going, and tight controls mean no excuses.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2880600?t=1771701155","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880600/ab61bebe76a7aa16f0403ad6c6233a75b0b3ff3b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771701155","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880600/c650d23f15ec53c5b9c9cbf90d23f3b1afdaead7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771701155","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880600/c650d23f15ec53c5b9c9cbf90d23f3b1afdaead7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771701155","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3900610,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built for speed. Designed for precision. This is racing stripped down to its core\u2014just you, the track, and the clock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this sci-fi <strong>time trial</strong>, you\u2019ll take on  high-speed tracks with nothing in your way except your own limits. There are no opponents, no explosions\u2014just clean, responsive handling and the <strong>brutal pursuit of a faster lap</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every second matters. Every mistake sticks. The difference between a smooth run and a reset is often a single input too late. Your biggest enemy? Your own skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is about learning the lines, trusting your instincts, unlocking and customizing new cars, and pushing to the top of the <strong>leaderboard</strong>. Instant restarts keep the momentum going, and tight controls mean no excuses.</p>","developers":["SuspiciousMosquito"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2880600/fa89ffb4be9e9495380b26a06e0a7cdc2a6dae81/header.jpg?t=1771701155","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2880600/984959544/2daff071c0a42c6f4660877ad35d493a9607248f/1753817676/dash_av1.mpd?t=1754075230","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2880600/984959544/2daff071c0a42c6f4660877ad35d493a9607248f/1753817676/dash_h264.mpd?t=1754075230","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2880600/984959544/2daff071c0a42c6f4660877ad35d493a9607248f/1753817676/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1754075230","id":257175458,"name":"main video","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257175458/c17f957f4fd81ce59fb9d4c6bdf20603d006864b/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1754075230"}],"name":"Tired","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\